{"unit_id":"SaiSenBox__dsh-prompt-manager#card-zh","repo":"SaiSenBox/dsh-prompt-manager","commit":"d55b31bb4dad65e061a652b32d52fa5ddd31bb30","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-manager 是面向 DSH Web 的本地双语提示词库，在设置页管理提示词，并通过会话输入区和斜杠选择器启用。它把选中的提示词作为当前会话的系统指令，可组合多条并让新建分支继承。用户可以搜索、收藏、编辑提示词，也能导入或导出 JSON 备份；数据保存在浏览器并镜像到本机文件。适合需要在 DSH 会话中反复使用固定指令的人。安装使用 DSH 插件命令，无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1561-1585","lib/index.js:488-497"]}
{"unit_id":"SaiSenBox__dsh-prompt-manager#card-en","repo":"SaiSenBox/dsh-prompt-manager","commit":"d55b31bb4dad65e061a652b32d52fa5ddd31bb30","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Manage reusable prompts in DSH Web with dsh-prompt-manager. Create and search prompts in Settings, then select them from the composer or slash picker as session system instructions. Branches inherit selections. Import or export JSON backups. Data stays local; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1561-1585","lib/index.js:488-497"]}
