{"unit_id":"SaiSenBox__dsh-prompt-manager#caveat-1","repo":"SaiSenBox/dsh-prompt-manager","commit":"d55b31bb4dad65e061a652b32d52fa5ddd31bb30","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-manager 使用前须知：默认仅允许本机页面访问读写接口；远程管理需设置 DSH_PROMPT_MANAGER_ALLOW_REMOTE=1（见 lib/index.js:60-85）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-85"]}
